        "name": "Hunt",
        "intent": "Home in on the player, spinning; two hits and it bursts.",
        "source": "\nbehavior Hunt\n  on tick\n    let p = find(\"Player\")\n    if exists(p) then\n      move self toward p at self.speed\n    end\n    rotate self by (0, 200 * dt, 0)\n  end\n  on event \"hit\"\n    self.hp = self.hp - 1\n    self.scale = (1.3, 1.3, 1.3)\n    if self.hp <= 0 then\n      spawn(\"prefab:prefabs/boom.prefab.json\", self.position)\n      emit \"kill\" to find(\"Player\")\n      destroy self\n    end\n  end\nend",
        "enabled": true
